{
  "name": "lifting-react",
  "version": "0.0.0",
  "private": true,
  "description": "Browser UI for the lifting slice: the planned workout the lifter enters reps for and submits, the outcome of a submitted workout, starting a training plan definition at chosen loads, the training plan definition editor, and the workout history. Plain props and callbacks over lifting-core's narrowed FHIR resources; nothing here fetches, mints ids or decides a progression.",
